st of them.\n\nSo I need to know where the information starts. That decides whether we add a column to the nightly file, give someone a way to post a cancellation directly, or read it from another system.\n\nWhen a sailing is cancelled today, how does the ferry office find out, and how do they tell passengers now?","ttft_ms":7633,"type":"result","duration_ms":10344,"uuid":"2bafc862-e26c-42b3-b34d-dcea8dc764c5","ttft_stream_ms":2458,"time_to_request_ms":46,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":6,"system_prompt":14,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":0,"input_attachments":3,"input_hooks":11,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":2,"engine_pickup":1,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":0,"query_setup":1,"auto_mode_context_wait":1,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":1,"message_normalization":0,"client_creation":3,"request_build":2},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":0,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":84,"time_to_request_major_faults":1,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"queued_commands","slowest_producer_ms":1,"cpu_ms":4,"major_faults":0},"first_content_frame_ms":2458,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
